  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d920\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074381/description_8a28f430-e0f6-421a-8cb4-b289d35ba564.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>一個非常小的附加模組，專為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scorched-guns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SCORCHED GUNS 2</a> 設計，在遊戲世界中新增鋅礦，以及黃銅合金與黃銅錠。此舉能讓彈殼所需的黃銅供應更為穩定。主要供未安裝 Create 或其他新增黃銅之模組的玩家使用。預設已相容於 Immersive Engineering。</p>",
